# Rumbelo E2E (Playwright)

Requires seeded demo accounts (`pnpm db:seed` after migrations + `auth:migrate`).

```bash
# terminals: infra up, backend + application running
pnpm --filter @rumbelo/e2e install:browsers
pnpm test:e2e:smoke
pnpm test:e2e:plan
```

| Persona | Email | Password | Plan |
|---------|-------|----------|------|
| Basic | basic@rumbelo.com | RumbeloDemo1! | BASIC |
| Plus | plus@rumbelo.com | RumbeloDemo1! | PLUS |
| Max | max@rumbelo.com | RumbeloDemo1! | MAX |

Override via `APP_URL`, `E2E_BASIC_EMAIL`, `E2E_PLUS_EMAIL`, `E2E_MAX_EMAIL`, `E2E_*_PASSWORD`.
